WEBVTT

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:02.182
Hi, I'm Pippin!

00:00:02.182 --> 00:00:05.451
Here's how Hindsight recalls a fact from long ago that a

00:00:05.451 --> 00:00:06.639
context window would lose.

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:12.358
The idea: make memory a structured thing the agent reasons over.

00:00:12.358 --> 00:00:15.741
Four networks keep what it saw apart from what it believes.

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:23.410
Most agent memory is top-k chunks in a vector store, blurring what

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:25.248
happened with what the agent thinks.

00:00:25.669 --> 00:00:31.527
Hindsight splits memory into four networks and runs three operations: retain, recall, and reflect.

00:00:33.467 --> 00:00:33.790
Retain.

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:37.994
An open model reads the chat and pulls out a few self-contained facts.

00:00:38.414 --> 00:00:41.924
Each fact goes into one of four networks, wired into a graph

00:00:41.924 --> 00:00:43.386
by entity, time, and cause.

00:00:43.806 --> 00:00:47.750
To recall, four retrievers search the bank at once: by meaning, keyword,

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:49.064
graph links, and time.

00:00:49.484 --> 00:00:53.249
Reciprocal Rank Fusion merges their lists by rank, then a cross-encoder

00:00:53.249 --> 00:00:54.617
reranks the top few.

00:00:55.037 --> 00:01:00.554
Reflect reasons over the result, shaped by disposition traits, forming or updating an opinion.

00:01:00.974 --> 00:01:04.096
Out comes an answer, grounded in a fact that never had to

00:01:04.096 --> 00:01:05.397
stay in the context window.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:11.024
On the long-memory benchmark the same small model jumps from thirty-nine to

00:01:11.024 --> 00:01:13.840
eighty-three point six once Hindsight is in front.

00:01:15.383 --> 00:01:19.236
A gain of forty-four point six points, from the memory layer alone.

00:01:19.236 --> 00:01:20.521
The model never changed.

00:01:23.267 --> 00:01:26.213
The memory layer, not a bigger model, carries the win.

00:01:26.213 --> 00:01:29.159
Structure the memory and a small model reads it well.

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:36.333
To recap: four networks that separate evidence from belief, retain, recall, reflect,

00:01:36.333 --> 00:01:39.289
and a big jump from the memory alone.

00:01:39.709 --> 00:01:41.704
Every source is in the full article.

00:01:41.704 --> 00:01:42.274
I'm Pippin.

00:01:42.274 --> 00:01:42.559
Bye!
